ef 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426348}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3ecabb9b-a95d-572c-bb9e-7f166638bf38" :question/math-academy-id "q-196453" :question/problem "Zoe distributed $\\frac{1}{2}$ kilograms of sausage equally between $4$ cats. How much sausage did each cat receive?\n\nExpressed as a fraction, each cat received\n{{field-1}}  kilograms of sausage." :question/worked-solution "To determine the amount of sausage per cat, we must divide the amount of sausage by the number of cats.\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}÷4\n$$\n\nTo divide a unit fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction's denominator by that whole number:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}÷4=\\frac{1}{2\\times 4}=\\frac{1}{8}\n$$\n\nTherefore, each cat received $\\frac{1}{8}$  kilograms of sausage."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426359 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073709 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb0eb807-0eda-5565-ae49-a89a97a5b016" :knowledge-point/title "Word Problems"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08a8925b-df15-5136-9a6e-fca7a8915100" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426312}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "08a8925b-df15-5136-9a6e-fca7a8915100" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426312} :answer-field/id #uuid "1dd78603-dcaf-519c-8371-d7573129f2bf" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426342}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "38810655-0448-5128-9773-0f9ac772e869" :question/math-academy-id "q-196454" :question/problem "A farmer divided his field into $3$ smaller lots of equal area. What is the area of each lot if the total area of the field is $\\frac{1}{2}$ acres?\n\nExpressed as a fraction, the area of each lot is\n{{field-1}} acres." :question/worked-solution "To determine the area of each lot, we divide the total field area by the number of lots.\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}÷3\n$$\n\nTo divide a unit fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction's denominator by that whole number:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}÷3=\\frac{1}{2\\times 3}=\\frac{1}{6}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of each lot is $\\frac{1}{6}$ acres."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426370 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073709 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb0eb807-0eda-5565-ae49-a89a97a5b016" :knowledge-point/title "Word Problems"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "71e1770e-c062-5537-bc64-69414203755f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426329}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "71e1770e-c062-5537-bc64-69414203755f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426329} :answer-field/id #uuid "bbb8a4f9-7f3c-55c2-ac3a-3b4d2bb27fd0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426351}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fa95cd0e-dc98-58e2-b9c5-ac52a083197b" :question/math-academy-id "q-197135" :question/problem "Sam has $\\frac{1}{3}$ cubic meters of wooden boards to make $2$ dog houses. If he uses the same amount of boards for each dog house, how many cubic meters does Sam use for each dog house?\n\nExpressed as a fraction, Sam uses\n{{field-1}} cubic meters of boards for each dog house." :question/worked-solution "To determine the amount of boards used for each dog house, we 